ksvg: ksvg (components for handling SVGs)
ksvg:
ksvg: A library for rendering SVG-based themes with stylesheet re-coloring
ksvg: and on-disk caching. KSvg provides both C++ classes and QtQuick
ksvg: components to render svgs based on image packs. Compared to plain
ksvg: QSvg, it caches the rendered images on disk with KImageCache, and can
ksvg: re-color properly crafted svg shapes that include internal
ksvg: stylesheets.
